  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "思念"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>晏冠仁</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>落雨天</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">落雨天</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">總--是hōo我想著你</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī天頂做天使ê你</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit-má好--無？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你講</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px; text-align: left;\"><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">落雨天真顧人怨</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雨絲hōo你感覺tsiok憂愁</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我mā無愛落雨天</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">因為伊mā hōo我感覺tsiok憂愁</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我ê憂愁</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是因為</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">對你ê思念……</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>善霸</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你ê學生講</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有ê人惡事做盡</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是惡霸</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kan-na你</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是善霸</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">啥mih好代誌lóng hōo你做了--ah</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄-koh</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我甘願你無做hiah-nī濟好代誌</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Án-ne</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">上帝就bē因為m̄甘你siunn忝</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">早早kā你接去天頂歇睏</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hōo我逐改想著你</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心就tsiok疼……</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>茯苓糕</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ē記得hit年過年</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你iáu-koh ē-tàng自由行踏ê時</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán做伙去peh山</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">歇喘ê時</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你看著有人leh賣茯苓糕</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsiok想beh食</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Suah講——</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">癌細胞愛食甜　我bē-sái食</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">後--來　你疼kah擋bē tiâu</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就án-ne去蹛院</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一直到上帝接你tńg--去</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">tsiah出院</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我逐改看著賣茯苓糕--ê</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lóng tsiok想beh買hōo你食</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">叫我全部lóng買mā無要緊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">只要ē-tàng koh看著你食茯苓糕ê</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">滿足、歡喜ê表情</span></p></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就好……</span></p><div><br /></div><p>&nbsp;</p><a name='more'></a><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3-3nOfVuGJxNN9282jeWUimM-i6Uyl54YP39jhkCT6i4YqwLfopdytdm0QL2h4cFWvVlFFSid-Gs9Vw2cFMwMsv3Fihgh8YBmC8F6bQhr8st5Qtl9PX3QqnNBhFlDrjawlIT5SFmdUz1Ehmr7buQ8DZRkZdWRqNAgubWcbuu3KDS47GNtJYACAKvOpk2L/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1367%E6%9C%9F_6.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3-3nOfVuGJxNN9282jeWUimM-i6Uyl54YP39jhkCT6i4YqwLfopdytdm0QL2h4cFWvVlFFSid-Gs9Vw2cFMwMsv3Fihgh8YBmC8F6bQhr8st5Qtl9PX3QqnNBhFlDrjawlIT5SFmdUz1Ehmr7buQ8DZRkZdWRqNAgubWcbuu3KDS47GNtJYACAKvOpk2L/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1367%E6%9C%9F_6.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEimlbsidLpp1VJzadhSRRf3hGckB7A8uxgsrOS3fo8sNBzjdTdav5iTJWhqp-jlDVECcw39b40-FchJ3K_FBm4Jmq2j-LF7dpCTFgxr_eCmcmDN1Q0ZSPSq6jbYfKa9UTPzdOmBASGX1sf98jP6hLQ68_HuTg7J7A7hucmoizl1NeTmgn9APJ0HjatQz3sA/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1367%E6%9C%9F_7.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEimlbsidLpp1VJzadhSRRf3hGckB7A8uxgsrOS3fo8sNBzjdTdav5iTJWhqp-jlDVECcw39b40-FchJ3K_FB